      "created_at": "2013-08-09T19:33:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Christopher and Adam are planning to be at Arsenal on Tuesday, August 13th, some time after 5pm.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sorry about the ambiguity in the timing, but this is going to be a pretty informal, thrown-together at the last minute thing. Through what, as far as I can tell, is some sort of fluke and/or miscommunication, Arsenal had 'Greater Than Games creators' on their schedule for Tue the 13th. That surprised me, so I asked Christopher about it and Christopher said that he didn't know about it, but there's no reason they _couldn't_ get into town early enough to do it, so they will.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please give a shout if you think you can make it, but also feel free just to show up.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:02.770Z",
