      "raw": "<p>Christopher and Adam are planning to be at Arsenal on Tuesday, August 13th, some time after 5pm.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sorry about the ambiguity in the timing, but this is going to be a pretty informal, thrown-together at the last minute thing. Through what, as far as I can tell, is some sort of fluke and/or miscommunication, Arsenal had &#39;Greater Than Games creators&#39; on their schedule for Tue the 13th. That surprised me, so I asked Christopher about it and Christopher said that he didn&#39;t know about it, but there&#39;s no reason they _couldn&#39;t_ get into town early enough to do it, so they will.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please give a shout if you think you can make it, but also feel free just to show up.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
