      "created_at": "2013-08-15T03:19:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had a great meetup with Christopher and Adam at Arsenal Tuesday. Over 25 people playing on 5 tables! Too many games to keep up with, but had a couple of great matches, including a overly agressive Omnitron with at Tomb of Anubis at 9 trials. Slow start for the heroes, but Tachyon souped up on bursts and Chrono Ranger hitting for 10 a turn with his Compound Bow took him down 46 in two turns. Second game was not nearly as hard against Apostate with heavy damage being dealt every turn. I know everyone at Arsenal had a great time.</p>",
