      "created_at": "2013-08-15T07:19:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Matchstickman, I don't see why that's implausible? &nbsp;The Portal Fiend (from Realm of Discord) deals the non-environment target with the second-highest HP a bunch of damage. &nbsp;No reason The Chairman couldn't have been that target.</p><p><strong>Update:</strong>&nbsp;Oops, The Chairman is immune to Environment cards.</p>",
